#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:5
#: c8164a214ab54bc88036a92377cc1f2a
msgid "Updating the Bootloader"
msgstr "更新引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:7
#: 10b04e5c90d94ac8ad058bd3746eb24f
msgid ""
"A Bootloader is a small piece of code that runs (normally just for a few "
"seconds) when an autopilot is powered on.  One of the bootloader's primary "
"responsibilities is to allow easy upgrading of the main firmware (i.e. "
"ArduPilot)"
msgstr "引导程序是飞控上电时运行（通常仅几秒钟）的一小段代码，其主要职责之一是便于升级主固件（即ArduPilot）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:9
#: 9630dc4b005c41589b03cd1b5acc5040
msgid ""
"Nearly all autopilots ship with a bootloader pre-installed and most users "
"will never need to upgrade it but there are some advantages to upgrading to "
"the latest ArduPilot specific bootloader:"
msgstr "几乎所有飞控出厂时均预装了引导程序，大多数用户无需升级。但升级至最新的ArduPilot专用引导程序有以下优势："

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:11
#: d08380ab13ae4a5fa183b46d0228e0c1
msgid ""
"Bug fixes like the \"Parameter Reset\" issue fix included with Copter-4.0.4,"
" Plane-4.0.6"
msgstr "错误修复，例如Copter-4.0.4、Plane-4.0.6中修复的「参数重置」问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:12
#: c0114310137f40ae9ab40e4d31902fbb
msgid ""
"The COM port name may be more recognisable.  For example it may include "
"\"ArduPilot\""
msgstr "COM端口名称可能更易识别，例如可能包含 「ArduPilot」 字样。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:16
#: 2ede21370d584e15ae7eee97dd6473be
msgid ""
"Updating the bootloader can potentially \"brick\" the board (i.e. make it "
"unresponsive and unable to upload new firmwares).  Be careful not to power "
"down the autopilot during the update process"
msgstr "更新引导程序有可能导致板子「变砖」（即无响应且无法上传新固件）。请务必在更新过程中不要断电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:19
#: 65381c20bbf04faab0b336dbe9f1be7d
msgid "Where can I download the latest bootloader?"
msgstr "在哪里下载最新引导程序？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:21
#: e6935e2bc5a545f99a9579de7094da57
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot specific bootloader is included within the ArduPilot firmware "
"but it lies dormant by default.  A special command must be sent to the main "
"ArduPilot firmware to install the new bootloader."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot专用引导程序已包含在ArduPilot固件中，但默认处于休眠状态。需要向ArduPilot主固件发送特殊命令才能安装新引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:26
#: d0e4d150c9b54ffc82b4661d7409b407
msgid ""
"some autopilots with 1MB of flash do NOT have the bootloader included to "
"save flash and the following attempts to upgrade from the firmware will "
"result in a failure message in Mission Planner or Mavproxy. In those cases, "
"you will need to flash the ``xxxx_bl.hex`` firmware for the autopilot using "
"DFU as explained in :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards` "
"as if it did not already have ArduPilot firmware loaded."
msgstr ""
"部分1MB闪存的飞控为节省空间，固件中不包含引导程序，此时通过固件升级的尝试将在Mission "
"Planner或MAVProxy中显示失败消息。在这种情况下，需要按照 :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"chibios-only-boards` 说明，使用DFU方式烧写飞控的 ``xxxx_bl.hex`` "
"固件，方式与未安装ArduPilot固件时相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:29
#: 9b28e146343942fab3a8a787210ef191
msgid "Upgrading using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用Mission Planner升级"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:31
#: 2b1744e6033c409e8e0694a2f4b4440d
msgid ""
"Install a recent version of ArduPilot to the autopilot (:ref:`with existing "
"ArduPilot firmware <common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk>`, :ref:`without "
"existing ArduPilot firmware <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-"
"boards>`)"
msgstr ""
"向飞控安装最新版本的ArduPilot（:ref:`已有ArduPilot固件 <common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"pixhawk>`，:ref:`无ArduPilot固件 <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-"
"boards>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:32
#: 67cb6408513a4673ac688c6be8b3055e
msgid ""
"Connect and check that the autopilot has at least 20k of free memory.  Open "
"the Data screen's Quick tab, double click on any entry and the select "
"\"freemem\"."
msgstr "连接飞控并确认其至少有20k的可用内存。打开数据页面的快速选项卡，双击任意条目后选择 「freemem」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:37
#: dd0a0c4b1b714a4a9cde38788c2a7232
msgid ""
"Open the Setup >> Install Firmware page and press the \"Bootloader Update\" "
"button"
msgstr "打开设置 >> 安装固件页面，点击 「Bootloader Update」 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:42
#: 31284f11d2584f35bd3815e5a5c76573
msgid "Reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:45
#: 5541cf19a2f540cda65bc64c981c71c7
msgid "Upgrading using QGC"
msgstr "使用QGC升级"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:47
#: a6625adf0f28435ea264cc9aa759438f
msgid ""
"The process is similar to using Mission Planner (see above) except the "
"\"Flash ChibiOS Bootloader\" button is found on the Configuration (Gear "
"icon), Firmware page"
msgstr ""
"操作步骤与Mission Planner类似（见上文），区别在于 「Flash ChibiOS Bootloader」 "
"按钮位于配置（齿轮图标）页面的固件页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:53
#: 1f058c3f99e94c28b1bb4d4d552e1e73
msgid "Upgrading with MAVProxy"
msgstr "使用MAVProxy升级"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:55
#: eeaf74e974a543009303e935ed1c3ecf
msgid "In the MAVProxy terminal, type, \"flashbootloader\""
msgstr "在MAVProxy终端中输入 「flashbootloader」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:58
#: 89a9b983b2b947038efa850de25cf9db
msgid "Extra Information"
msgstr "扩展信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:60
#: 1853ab3735fe40debb9e544bdf8d2b3a
msgid ""
"Developer specific information on Bootloaders can be found `here "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/bootloader.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"开发者相关引导程序信息可在 `此处 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/bootloader.html>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:61
#: a044584ac68d4a36b953bb2514eb56e3
msgid ""
"The source code for the bootloaders can be found in `Tools/AP_Bootloader "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/AP_Bootloader>`__"
msgstr ""
"引导程序源代码可在 `Tools/AP_Bootloader "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/AP_Bootloader>`__ "
"中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bootloader-update.rst:62
#: 2e6e4c40b33d4fac92e98eb88e24f986
msgid ""
"Pre-compiled binaries can be found on "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders/>`__"
msgstr ""
"预编译二进制文件可在 `firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders/>`__ 上找到。"
